✗ route registration failed

  ✗ path wildcard nothing binds

      pattern /books/{id} declares {id}, and no field of transport_test.wcNoParams carries `param:"id"`

      Every request binds "" for it: with validate:"required" the route
      400s for ever, without it the handler receives an empty identifier
      and reports NOT_FOUND. The published OpenAPI path is invalid either
      way — a templated segment with no parameter.

    Add the field, even if the handler ignores it:

        ID string `param:"id"`

    or drop {id} from the pattern.